# cairn
cairn/references/sources/
cairn/.merge-approved
cairn/.merge-approved.pending

# R
# R opens `pdf()` when something needs a device and none is current, leaving an
# Rplots.pdf wherever it was working. It is detritus, and `R CMD check` NOTEs it
# as a non-standard top-level file.
Rplots.pdf
**/Rplots.pdf
# testthat writes `*.new.*` beside a snapshot whose candidate did not match, and
# removes it on the next clean run. Transient by construction, so it is never
# committed -- a committed one reads as a second approved snapshot.
tests/testthat/_snaps/**/*.new.*
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
# The pkgdown site is built by .github/workflows/pkgdown.yaml and published to
# the gh-pages branch, so a `docs/` tree is only ever a local build artifact.
# `.Rbuildignore` already keeps it out of the tarball; this keeps it out of git.
docs/

# Python bytecode, from running .github/ci-usage.py
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tar.gz
